          "Echo"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "lineId": "shipinterior-interaction-001-line-001",
            "speaker": "Sbaak",
            "text": "今天的合成餐是「烤雞風味」……\n聞起來倒是蠻像回事的。",
            "randomGroupId": "random-group-1",
            "weight": 1
          },
          {
            "lineId": "shipinterior-interaction-001-line-002",
            "speaker": "Sbaak",
            "text": "（我盯著盤子裡淡黃色的方塊）\n……這東西以前真的有雞嗎？",
            "randomGroupId": "random-group-1",
            "weight": 1
          },
          {
            "lineId": "shipinterior-interaction-001-line-003",
            "speaker": "Sbaak",
            "text": "熱一份合成餐，填飽肚子才有力氣幹活。",
            "randomGroupId": "random-group-1",
            "weight": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      "failureDialogue": {
        "characterDelaySeconds": 0.02,
