            "lineId": "shipinterior-interaction-002-line-001",
            "speaker": "Sbaak",
            "text": "回收水的溫度剛好……洗把臉清醒一下。",
            "randomGroupId": "random-group-1",
            "weight": 1
          },
          {
            "lineId": "shipinterior-interaction-002-line-002",
            "speaker": "Sbaak",
            "text": "水壓穩定，回收循環也正常。\n（職業病，連洗個手都要檢查一下）",
            "randomGroupId": "random-group-1",
            "weight": 1
          },
          {
            "lineId": "shipinterior-interaction-002-line-003",
            "speaker": "Sbaak",
            "text": "把手上的機油洗乾淨……雖然等一下大概又會弄髒。",
            "randomGroupId": "random-group-1",
            "weight": 1
